WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.958
Reading the prompt as it is typed

2
00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:06.917
Mapping each word to a vector

3
00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:09.875
Scanning the vocabulary for related words

4
00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.417
Drafting an answer under the question

5
00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:16.500
Lining up words the answer could use

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.542
Packing the context into a grid of values

7
00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:24.500
Passing the grid through layer after layer

8
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Weighing the likely next words

9
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Picking one and adding it to the answer

10
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Resolving rough pixels into a smooth form

11
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Growing new forms out of the first

12
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.000
Trying variations in colour and shape

13
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Letting the forms tangle and recombine

14
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.500
Narrowing down to a single form

15
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.667
Gathering atoms into small molecules

16
00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:55.625
Stringing amino acids into a chain

17
00:00:55.625 --> 00:00:59.208
Coiling the chain into helices and rings

18
00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:03.000
Folding the chain into its lowest-energy shape

19
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.708
Breaking routine work into small tasks

20
00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:10.917
Writing the code that joins the pieces

21
00:01:10.917 --> 00:01:14.125
Playing the result back for review

22
00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:18.000
Searching the pile for what is needed
